  "question": {
    "text": "Sodium metal crystallizes in a body centred cubic lattice with a unit cell edge of <math><mn>4.29</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8491;</mi></math> . The radius of sodium atom is approximately:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0.93</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Å</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1.86</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Å</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3.22</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Å</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5.72</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Å</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For B.C.C lattice,<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mtext>r</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mtext>a</mtext> </mrow> </math></p><p>where&nbsp;&#39;r&#39; is radius of atom and &#39;a&#39; is edge length of unit cell<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>r</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>1.732</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mtext>4.29</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>1.86</mtext> <mi>&#197;</mi> </mrow> </math></p>"
  }
